		<title>PrimeXBT: What &#8220;Accumulation&#8221; Really Tells You About Bitcoin and Gold Right Now</title>
		<link>https://ventureburn.com/primexbt-what-accumulation-really-tells-you-about-bitcoin-and-gold-right-now/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Staff Reporter]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 13:45:11 +0000</pubDate>
