					<description><![CDATA[<p>Running a creative agency or consulting firm is harder than ever. Client demands keep rising quickly. At the same time, operating budgets stay tight. Leaders often guess whether individual projects</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://ventureburn.com/cor-raises-30m-ai-profitability-agencies-consultancies/" data-wpel-link="internal">COR Raises $30M To Boost AI-Driven Profitability For Agencies And Consultancies</a> appeared first on <a href="https://ventureburn.com" data-wpel-link="internal">Ventureburn</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400">Running a creative agency or consulting firm is harder than ever. Client demands keep rising quickly. At the same time, operating budgets stay tight. Leaders often guess whether individual projects actually make money. Traditional project software just cannot handle modern operational workloads.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">In an effort to address this specific challenge in the industry, COR raises $30m Series A growth funding round led by </span><a href="https://ftvcapital.com/2026/cor-secures-30-million-investment-from-ftv-capital/" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener external noreferrer" data-wpel-link="external"><span style="font-weight: 400">FTV Capital</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400">. The deal will enable the firm to further develop its AI-powered profitability platform. This tool provides professional service companies with a full project budget, team capacity and accurate financial margins.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">As agencies bring artificial intelligence tools into daily workflows, traditional work structures change. Teams now combine human employees with autonomous digital AI assistants. COR helps business leaders navigate this shift smoothly without losing track of bottom-line profits.</span></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400">COR Is Solving the Agency Profitability Crisis</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">For decades, consultancies and agencies relied on manual timesheets. Employees hated filling them out. Managers constantly struggled to calculate true project costs in real time. Standard project management tools track tasks, but they rarely reveal true profit margins behind those tasks.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">When projects run over budget unnoticed, service firms lose revenue silently. COR solves this issue by eliminating manual tracking completely. Its platform monitors project resources automatically.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">COR turns everyday task data into clear financial insights. Agency executives can finally see which clients drive real growth and which ones drain cash flow.</span></p>
<p><b><i>More Updates: </i></b><a href="https://ventureburn.com/greyparrot-secures-27-million-series-b-ai-waste-intelligence/" data-wpel-link="internal"><b><i>Greyparrot Secures $27M To Scale AI Waste Intelligence Platform</i></b></a></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400">How COR’s AI Platform Operates</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400">COR offers a single operational system for professional service businesses. The unified platform combines task management, automated time tracking, and resource planning. </span></p>
